---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Notice | Edenva"
  description="Privacy notice about the handling of personal data on the Edenva website."
  canonicalPath="/en/privacy/"
  langSwitchHref="/privacidad/"
  h1="Privacy Notice"
  breadcrumbLabel="Privacy Notice"
  noindex
>
  <p><em>
    Initial draft — pending review by a lawyer before publishing without a noindex restriction.
  </em></p>

  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    Edenva Parque Ecoturístico ("Edenva", "we"), reachable at <a href="mailto:info@edenva.mx">info@edenva.mx</a>,
    is responsible for the handling of your personal data under this notice.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We collect the data you provide directly through our contact form (name, email and message). Tour bookings
    are processed directly on our external provider's platform, FareHarbor, subject to its own privacy notice.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel to measure site and ad-campaign performance. These tools only
    activate if you accept cookies from the banner shown on your first visit; you can reject them at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>4. How we use your data</h2>
  <p>
    We use your contact details only to respond to your questions or booking requests, and we don't share them
    with third parties except where necessary to process your booking (e.g. our ticketing provider).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by writing to
    <a href="mailto:info@edenva.mx">info@edenva.mx</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
